,["ARC or PLC in Covington County","/arc-plc/alabama/covington-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Covington County came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years for September to October and for October to November. In 2025, October to November ran 41% of normal on the middle of the grids. In 2026 so far, March to April sat at 32% and May to June at 225% on the middle. Grid 13074 had its driest year in 1954 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
